{"3842430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Orange Life", "steam_appid": 3842430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🍊 Welcome to Orange Life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You spawn into the world as... well, an orange. No explanation, no backstory — just you, your bouncy peel, and a strange ramp calling your name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb it, and whatever you do — <strong>don’t stop at the top</strong>. A super sprint will launch you forward at insane speed. The laws of physics? Optional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You also have a special ability: the <strong>Mega Jump</strong>. Press <strong>SPACEBAR</strong> to jump... and keep pressing. Each jump boosts your strength, letting you leap higher and higher like a juicy superhero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your first mission and earn the ultimate reward: <strong>a car</strong>.<br>It’s got first-person and third-person modes, a fuel system (don’t run out!), and full orange-powered movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and since you gathered all those oranges... you can now <strong>throw infinite oranges</strong>. For fun. Or chaos. Your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪂 Jump like a maniac.<br>💦 Avoid water (you can’t swim — you’re an orange, remember?).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No deep narrative. No complex systems. Just pure, ridiculous fun in a surreal open world.<br>Welcome to <strong>Orange Life</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🍊 Welcome to Orange Life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You spawn into the world as... well, an orange. No explanation, no backstory — just you, your bouncy peel, and a strange ramp calling your name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb it, and whatever you do — <strong>don’t stop at the top</strong>. A super sprint will launch you forward at insane speed. The laws of physics? Optional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You also have a special ability: the <strong>Mega Jump</strong>. Press <strong>SPACEBAR</strong> to jump... and keep pressing. Each jump boosts your strength, letting you leap higher and higher like a juicy superhero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your first mission and earn the ultimate reward: <strong>a car</strong>.<br>It’s got first-person and third-person modes, a fuel system (don’t run out!), and full orange-powered movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and since you gathered all those oranges... you can now <strong>throw infinite oranges</strong>. For fun. Or chaos. Your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪂 Jump like a maniac.<br>💦 Avoid water (you can’t swim — you’re an orange, remember?).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No deep narrative. No complex systems. Just pure, ridiculous fun in a surreal open world.<br>Welcome to <strong>Orange Life</strong></p>", "short_description": "Step into the bittersweet chaos of Orange Life — a narrative-driven game where every choice matters and nothing is quite what it seems", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842430/ef25070b1559d3fe26f7d3b53ae7636f7150e306/header.jpg?t=1782650970", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842430/22489f4dff378c86544c9d8821076cc26f7cca8d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782650970", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842430/22489f4dff378c86544c9d8821076cc26f7cca8d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782650970", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  NVIDIA GTX 750 Ti / AMD R7 260X<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li